    {
      "text": "his seed shall inherit the earth, Ps. 25:13. those that wait upon the Lord … inherit the earth, Ps. 37:9. meek shall inherit the earth, Ps. 37:11 (Matt. 5:5; 3 Ne. 12:5; D&C 88:17). earth which he hath established for ever, Ps. 78:69. earth abideth for ever, Eccl. 1:4. new heavens and a new earth, Isa. 65:17 (Rev. 21:1; Ether 13:9). earth shall yield her increase, Ezek. 34:27. earth shall be filled with the knowledge of the glory, Hab. 2:14. earth shall be devoured with the fire of my jealousy, Zeph. 3:8. turn the heart … lest I come and smite the earth, Mal. 4:6 (3 Ne. 25:6).",
